### Tribunal record for this phase

Four iterations, two VETOs, both on the same defect shape: a route into the failure left open and undeclared. V-2 was the omission route into a vacuous glossary check; V-3 was the second sealed-history consumer. The phase's own contribution -- a schema prohibition -- is what made the second one reachable, which is why the seal ladder found it and the first two tribunal rounds did not.

